{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：05:53 2026-11-26 HKT<br/>發佈時間：05:53 2026-11-26 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：05:53 2026-11-26 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/170105a109638f622f5d6ca7dc2f5fca/2026-11/2026-11-25_21_53_11.png\"/><p>港鐵表示，由於天水圍站有工程車設備故障，屯馬綫的列車班次已調整。候車時間預計會比平日多10至15分鐘。來往屯門至元朗預計约需25分鐘。</p><p>港鐵表示，人員正在處理，並盡快安排免費接駁巴士，將於稍後時間到達。</p><p>港鐵現正提供免費接駁巴士來往元朗站和屯門站，途經沿途各站。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5805c5d52dbb7dee3c593ea288f6ff99/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_21_59_50_0.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6e0d26c543377a658cd52e15fe0dcfe4/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_21_59_50_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T22:16:23.418605+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":3,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T21:53:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T22:09:52.466368+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T22:09:52.466368+00:00","content_hash":"a26bb7c976034d62cf13aa2bc54e87bd673993157dd02dae70c8438457b0cab6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}